---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "@/layouts/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/layouts/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy · ALC Cars">
	<Header />

	<main class="flex-1 bg-orange-50 px-4 py-12">
		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl card bg-white shadow-xl p-8 sm:p-10 space-y-10">
			<header class="space-y-2">
				<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: September 2026</p>
			</header>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Data controller</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					ALC Cars, with offices at Alicante-Elche Airport (ALC), Departures,
					03195 L'Altet, Alicante, is the controller of the personal data
					collected through this website. Contact: +34 965 123 456.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. Data we collect</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
					<li>Identification and contact details (name, last name, email, phone).</li>
					<li>Identification details required by law (ID or passport, driving license).</li>
					<li>Booking details (dates, selected vehicle and extras).</li>
					<li>Payment details and the card used.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Purpose of processing</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1">
					<li>Managing and confirming car rental bookings.</li>
					<li>Providing the contracted service and handling post-rental incidents.</li>
					<li>Billing, accounting and compliance with legal obligations.</li>
					<li>Managing the customer account and, where applicable, handling complaints.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Legal basis</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					We process data on the basis of the performance of the rental contract,
					the consent of the data subject given through our data collection
					forms, and compliance with the legal obligations applicable to ALC
					Cars.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Retention</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					Data is kept for as long as the contractual relationship lasts and,
					afterwards, for the periods legally required to comply with tax and
					accounting obligations.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Third-party services</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					This website is hosted on technical platforms that may process data for
					security and operational purposes (for example, the hosting provider).
					We do not share personal data with third parties for advertising
					purposes, except where required by law.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">7. Cookies</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					This website only uses cookies that are strictly necessary for the
					service to work (session and booking management). You can set your
					cookie preferences from the corresponding panel in your browser.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">8. Your rights</h2>
				<p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
					You may exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure,
					objection, restriction of processing and data portability by writing
					to ALC Cars or calling +34 965 123 456, providing proof of identity.
					You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data
					Protection Agency (www.aepd.es).
				</p>
			</section>
		</article>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</BaseLayout>